        },
        {
          "text": " Bobo da abu Daudi ka ikapolok luka aiore kotiak ice lukodwe luka Asap, ka luka Keman, ka luka Yedutun, aijaanakin, luedwarete kadeudeun, ka isabulin, ka ikacwi: lo ŋes etiaikec kanul kalueswamaete aswam kwape ajaar aijaanakinikec: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lukodwe luka Asap; Sakur, ka Yosep, ka Netania, ka Asarela, odwe luka Asap; kakan naka Asap luadwarenenete kwape ajaar aicorakinet naka ekabaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luka Yedutun: odwe luka Yedutun; Gedalia, ka Seri, ka Yesaia, ka Kasabia, ka Matitia, ikanykape; kakan naka papakec Yedutun kadeudeu, luadwarenenete kaimal kaiturit EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luka Keman: odwe luka Keman; Bukia, ka Matania, ka Usiel, ka Sebuel, ka Yerimot, ka Kanania, ka Kanani, ka Eliata, ka Gidaliti, ka Romamiti-eser, ka Yosebekasa, ka Maloti, ka Kotir, ka Makasiot: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
